          {
            "_key": "about-p1-span",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "I'm a full-stack software engineer specializing in React, TypeScript, Node.js, and Python. I build production systems across enterprise, AI automation, healthcare, and IoT — from designing backend architecture to shipping polished user interfaces."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "about-p2",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "about-p2-span",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "I've delivered 5+ live applications serving over 1,000 concurrent users, including an enterprise HRIS for 500+ employees and 8 deployed AI chatbot systems. My work spans the full lifecycle — system design, database architecture, API development, and frontend engineering — always with a focus on reliability and measurable outcomes."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "about-p3",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "about-p3-span",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "I graduated Cum Laude with a BS in Computer Science from the University of Caloocan City (Batch 2026), recognized as a Dean's Lister throughout my studies. I'm currently targeting fullstack, AI/automation, or backend engineering roles where technical ownership and cross-functional execution drive real product impact."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      }
